{"status":"question","question":{"text":"Vite + React + Vitest — locked in, good call. Before I can shape the initialization mission, I need to know what this app actually *is*. In one or two plain-language sentences: what are we building, and who's it for? (I only need enough to pick the one thin vertical slice that proves the skeleton and tests are wired together — I won't build the product itself in this mission.)","recommended":"Tell me the core idea in your own words — e.g. \"a personal habit tracker\", \"an internal dashboard for support tickets\", \"a recipe box\" — and I'll take it from there."},"prd":"# Mission: Initialize project foundation (Vite + React + Vitest)\n\n**Type:** feature\n**Goal:** Stand up a running Vite + React skeleton with a wired Vitest test system, proven connected by one thin vertical slice.\n\n_(PRD in progress — capturing what we're building before defining the vertical slice.)_\n\n**Stack (recommended, captain-accepted):** Vite + React + Vitest\n"}

